1233" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1233"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasza8z3h/"></a>&#8212; 1,2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1234/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1234" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1234"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas760at0/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1235/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1235" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1235"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7hmnb1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1236/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1236" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1236"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5y0r1m/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1237/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1237" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1237"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdu248s/"></a>&#8212; 2,4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1238/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1238" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1238"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdnubgy/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1239/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1239" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1239"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7aa95a/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1240/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1240" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1240"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxn1am2/"></a>Примечание. Государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за регистрацию, публикацию и выдачу патентов уплачивается в течение трех месяцев с даты направления решения об экспертизе. Если государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) уплачена по истечении указанного срока, но не позднее шести месяцев, ее размер увеличивается на 50 процентов.</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1241/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1241" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1241"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrtxsn4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1242/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1242" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1242"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask3op73/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1243/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1243" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1243"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashit863/"></a>г) за поддержание в действии патентов</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1244/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1244" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1244"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskwl4u2/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1245/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1245" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1245"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9v4scm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1246/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1246" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1246"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasam3r55/"></a>поддержание в действии патента на полезную модель ежегодно с даты подачи заявки за каждый год действия</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1247/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1247" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasokucrt/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1248" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1248"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq4696s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1249/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1249" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1249"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8sug6o/"></a>в пределах 5 лет</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1250/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1250" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1250"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmrwie1/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1251/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1251" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1251"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastzzo2s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1252/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1252" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1252"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspvnbmd/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1253/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1253" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1253"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfo9m4h/"></a>&#8212; 2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1254/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1254" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1254"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuzskob/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1255/" data-role="phra