rites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1351"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxh3nob/"></a>&#8212; 6-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1352/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1352" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1352"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5r8114/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1353/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1353" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1353"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasawfbuo/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1354/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1354" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1354"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgidxb4/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1355/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1355" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1355"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasep5x0h/"></a>&#8212; 12-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1356/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1356" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1356"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfason8717/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1357/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1357" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1357"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgdownu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1358/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1358" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1358"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9vifyg/"></a>Примечание. Государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за поддержание в действии патента на изобретение за третий год с даты подачи заявки уплачивается одновременно с пошлиной за выдачу патента, за последующие годы &#8212; в течение последних трех месяцев текущего года.</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1359/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1359" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1359"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastzrsbc/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1360/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1360" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1360"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspb7vxq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1361/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1361" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1361"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas0s98li/"></a>поддержание в действии патента на промышленный образец ежегодно с даты подачи заявки</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a dat