 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1385/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1385" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1385"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskd1x3x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1386/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1386" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1386"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaseyq20o/"></a>за одиннадцатый &#8212; пятнадцатый годы (продление за каждый год)</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1387/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1387" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1387"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas13bzeu/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1388/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1388" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1388"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspyrxsn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1389/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1389" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1389"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaso4l2wm/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1390/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1390" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1390"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrbv493/"></a>&#8212; 4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1391/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1391" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1391"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnwt8lw/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1392/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1392" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1392"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu93wil/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1393/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1393" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1393"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6n0vcv/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1394/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1394" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1394"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrdywqu/"></a>&#8212; 8-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1395/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1395" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1395"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqegz15/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1396/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1396" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1396"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslpaz0n/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1397/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1397" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1397"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas91ioug/"></a>Примечание. Государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за поддержание в действии патента на промышленный образец ежегодно уплачивается за три года с даты подачи заявки &#8212; одновременно с пошлиной за выдачу патента, за последующие годы &#8212; в течение последних трех месяцев до истечения срока действия патента.</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1398/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1398" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1398"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9wr9ee/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1399/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1399" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1399"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswwelp0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1400/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1400" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1400"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7a5zl0/"></a>дополнинельная государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина)</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1401/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1401" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1401"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase491h0/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1402/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1402" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1402"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqmaivh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1403/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1403" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1403"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascf7xlu/"></a>за предоставление 6-месячного срока после истечения срока действия патента</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1404/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1404" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1404"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase59h49/"></a>&#8212; 100 процентов от установленного размера</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1405/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1405" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1405"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasil0wg4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1406/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1406" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1406"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasydx5rg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1407/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1407" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1407"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqgi91h/"></a>за восстановление действия патента на изобретение, полезную модель, промышленный образец</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1408/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1408" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1408"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasd3fl8n/"></a>&#8212; 200 процентов от размера пошлины, установленного за поддержание в действии патента (на тот год действия патента, на который приходится дата подачи ходатайства о его восстановлении)</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1409/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1409" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1409"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskfa56b/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1410/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1410" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1410"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmyo13r/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1411/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1411" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1411"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg5ocwm/"></a>д) за регистрацию договоров о передаче прав на изобретения, полезные модели, промышленные образцы</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1412/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1412" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1412"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuq7gyv/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1413/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1413" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1413"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasz81afe/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1414/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1414" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1414"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbncei8/"></a>регистрация лицензионного договора, содержащего</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1415/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1415" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1415"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbstmgx/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1416/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1416" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1416"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgngf3w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1417/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1417" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1417"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfassgkg7g/"></a>один патент на изобретение, промышленный образец, патент на полезную модель</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1418/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1418" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1418"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8za2qw/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1419/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1419" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1419"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslvptzs/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1420/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1420" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1420"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5k6grr/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1421/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1421" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1421"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasc2p99w/"></a>&#8212; 6-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1422/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1422" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1422"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7ippic/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1423/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1423" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1423"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfyvqq1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1424/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1424" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1424"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7hnfy3/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1425/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1425" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1425"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfwogor/"></a>&#8212; 12-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1426/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1426" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1426"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9e1ra9/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1427/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1427" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1427"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasc0p63g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1428/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1428" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1428"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7ecgtc/"></a>несколько патентов на изобретение, промышленный образец, патентов на полезную модель, дополнительно за каждый охранный документ, упомянутый в лицензионном договоре</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1429/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1429" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1429"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqy0a4e/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1430/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1430" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1430"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvxcdoo/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1431/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1431" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1431"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas28hsmq/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1432/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1432" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1432"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasf5b6ar/"></a>&#8212; 2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1433/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1433" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1433"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas99lbki/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1434/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1434" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1434"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslwvohp/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1435/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1435" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1435"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnspwvn/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1436/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1436" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1436"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7gnb6v/"></a>&#8212; 4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1437/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1437" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1437"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasra6fhb/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1438/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1438" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1438"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3r296o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1439/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1439" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1439"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasl6bgew/"></a>за регистрацию договора об уступке</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1440/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1440" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1440"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv9d2lo/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1441/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1441" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1441"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyoi38g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1442/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1442" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1442"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasya6ngg/"></a>патента на изобретение, полезную модель, промышленный образец</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1443/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1443" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1443"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasetr2vl/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1444/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1444" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1444"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascg7a34/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1445/" data-role="phrase-anchor" d