ase-anchor="bssPhr1568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas498n5x/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqbbgii/"></a>&#8212; 4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrwqns3/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspfzf7a/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5lga10/"></a>продление срока</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4y57ze/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-ph