cument/90/21477/dfas9rk3d3/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1745/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1745" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1745"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8frc3v/"></a>&#8212; 1,2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1746/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1746" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1746"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasz8pagh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1747/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1747" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1747"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfast8p41t/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1748/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1748" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1748"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas766bws/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1749/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1749" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1749"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3nsvwy/"></a>&#8212; 2,4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1750/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1750" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1750"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask3wesk/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1751/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1751" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1751"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfast6h7gr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1752/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1752" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1752"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasx0xhy3/"></a>Примечание. Государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за регистрацию, публикацию и выдачу патентов уплачивается в течение трех месяцев с даты направления решения экспертизы. Если государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) уплачена по истечении указанного срока, но не позднее шести месяцев, ее размер увеличивается на 50 процентов.</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1753/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1753" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1753"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmyh1nu/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1754/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1754" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1754"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdr4axx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1755/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1755" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1755"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7vmugg/"></a>г) за поддержание в действии патента на селекционное достижение</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1756/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1756" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1756"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspp56vh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1757/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1757" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1757"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask99x6s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1758/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1758" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1758"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas03s6la/"></a>поддержание в действии патента на селекционное достижение с даты регистрации за каждый год действия</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1759/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1759" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1759"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfnn8w8/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1760/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1760" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1760"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnw96bz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1761/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1761" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1761"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyrb9ux/"></a>за первый &#8212; третий годы</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1762/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1762" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1762"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8x2n4g/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1763/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1763" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1763"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasoucb3w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1764/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1764" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1764"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfast63ni8/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1765/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1765" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1765"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8f71nr/"></a>&#8212; 40 процентов БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr1766/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="1766" data-dwh-source-type-favorit