н товарных знаков</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2081/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2081" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2081"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasz898to/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2082/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2082" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2082"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswsabfl/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2083/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2083" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2083"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask62oee/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2084/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2084" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2084"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasblcu8t/"></a>&#8212; 1,2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2085/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2085" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2085"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastz97xb/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2086/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2086" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phra