ному товарному знаку</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2092/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2092" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2092"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasob7atl/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2093/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2093" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2093"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastrwnyn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2094/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2094" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2094"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasch36ix/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2095/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2095" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2095"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasri83gm/"></a>&#8212; 40 процентов БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2096/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2096" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2096"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasp808an/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2097/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2097" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2097"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8lyl2x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2098/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2098" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2098"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswcl8ud/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2099/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2099" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2099"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasde9pee/"></a>&#8212; 80 процентов БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2100/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2100" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2100"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5pgnqk/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2101/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2101" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2101"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasno5byz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2102/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2102" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2102"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase3l17h/"></a>выдача свидетельства</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2103/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2103" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2103"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3bggyh/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2104/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2104" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2104"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasy1doa2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2105/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2105" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2105"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6hirrp/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2106/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2106" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2106"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfash2g01p/"></a>&#8212; 1,2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2107/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2107" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2107"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6aukec/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2108/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2108" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2108"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuvofo4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2109/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2109" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2109"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8p0hi2/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2110/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2110" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2110"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfash7gmik/"></a>&#8212; 2,4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2111/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2111" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2111"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswrgzcb/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2112/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2112" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2112"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastxs1gl/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2113/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2113" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2113"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu66hce/"></a>Примечание. Государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за регистрацию, публикацию и выдачу свидетельства уплачивается в течение трех месяцев с даты направления решения экспертизы или решения Апелляционного совета о признании товарного знака общеизвестным в Республике Узбекистан. Если государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) уплачена по истечении указанного срока, но не позднее шести месяцев, ее размер увеличивается на 50 процентов.</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2114/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2114" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2114"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasclgbhp/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2115/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2115" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2115"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasadmug0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2116/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2116" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2116"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashcatdo/"></a>в) за поддержание в действии свидетельств</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2117/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2117" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2117"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq4e8g6/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2118/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2118" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2118"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasz8eoas/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2119/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2119" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2119"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgtatp1/"></a>за продление срока действия свидетельства на товарный знак</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2120/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2120" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2120"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr9fqp2/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2121/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2121" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2121"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasa3fl8h/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2122/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2122" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2122"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuk31z2/"></a>для одного класса Международной классификации товаров и услуг</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2123/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2123" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2123"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmdw1vn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2124/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2124" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2124"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbgex4x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 5