e-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2170"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq7xmut/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2171/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2171" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2171"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasoviywk/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2172/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2172" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2172"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4zp7cu/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2173/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2173" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2173"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu5kltn/"></a>&#8212; 3-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2174/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2174" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2174"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3vhltf/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2175/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2175" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2175"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasn9501t/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2176/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2176" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2176"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasun7e2x/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2177/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2177" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2177"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspnpo6y/"></a>&#8212; 6-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2178/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2178" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2178"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbr3cmp/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2179/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2179" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2179"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashtuyte/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2180/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2180" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2180"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv3n4u5/"></a>Примечание. Государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за поддержание в действии уплачивается за первый год &#8212; одновременно с пошлиной за регистрацию, публикацию и выдачу свидетельства, за последующие годы &#8212; в течение последнего года до окончания срока действия свидетельства.</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2181/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2181" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2181"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaso8rms4/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2182/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2182" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2182"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnfu1od/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2183/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2183" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2183"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswwii3h/"></a>дополнительная государственная пошлина (патентная пошлина) за предоставление 6-месячного срока после истечения срока действия свидетельства</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2184/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2184" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2184"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasawircu/"></a>&#8212; 100 процентов от установленного размера пошлины</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2185/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2185" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2185"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqmgmdn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2186/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2186" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2186"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas59g60u/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2187/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2187" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2187"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas99dl00/"></a>г) за регистрацию договоров о передаче прав на товарные знаки</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2188/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2188" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2188"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslbiwu2/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2189/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2189" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2189"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1k79bk/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2190/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2190" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2190"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasd6963l/"></a>регистрация лицензионного договора, содержащего</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2191/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2191" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2191"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1p8hkm/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2192/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2192" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2192"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbywlxt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2193/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2193" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2193"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaseb8i9a/"></a>один товарный знак</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2194/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2194" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2194"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr8d180/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2195/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2195" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2195"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9qtvai/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2196/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2196" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2196"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6zp9ol/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2197/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2197" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2197"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/d