qmx/"></a>разделение заявки на товарный знак (за каждую выделенную заявку из первоначальной) или за разделение регистрации товарного знака (за каждую вновь образованную регистрацию)</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2277/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2277" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2277"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgu8fzn/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2278/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2278" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2278"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszwhdew/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2279/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2279" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2279"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslg4520/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2280/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2280" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2280"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszkx39g/"></a>&#8212; 1,5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2281/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2281" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2281"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5st5vw/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: 