нение заявителя в связи с уступкой права на заявку на регистрацию товарного знака, поданную в период от даты подачи заявки до даты регистрации товарного знака</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2288/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2288" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2288"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas56lmgv/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2289/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2289" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2289"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase8ym2f/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2290/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2290" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2290"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9tyegr/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2291/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2291" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2291"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4kiibq/"></a>&#8212; 1,5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2292/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2292" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2292"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas23py4n/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a