восстановление сроков представления документов по запросу экспертизы</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2299/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2299" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2299"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvtrrn6/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2300/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2300" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2300"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg5zbep/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2301/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2301" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2301"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascnxkct/"></a>продление установленного законодательством срока представления ответа на запрос экспертизы по заявкам на товарные знаки, географические указания и наименования мест происхождения товаров за каждый месяц продления</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2302/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2302" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2302"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr6klti/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2303/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2303" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2303"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas97dwcx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="w