n:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2360/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2360" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2360"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas87xifn/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2361/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2361" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2361"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspo3m4t/"></a>80 процентов БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2362/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2362" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2362"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfquo2y/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2363/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2363" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2363"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascgqkgn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2364/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2364" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2364"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasul5dtz/"></a>выдача свидетельства</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2365/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2365" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2365"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasklqh9n/"></a>&#160;</td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class