77/bssPhr2567/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2567" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2567"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasig9yng/"></a>внесение изменений в свидетельство на программу для ЭВМ и базу данных</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2568/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2568" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2568"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasy1z6yg/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2569/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2569" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2569"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascpgrm3/"></a>50 процентов БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2570/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2570" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2570"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas2g28te/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2571/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2571" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2571"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqplepg/"></a>1-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2572/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2572" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2572"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas26q63p/"></a>внесение изменений в договор на программу для ЭВМ и базу данных</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2573/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2573" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2573"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvuoq4u/"></a>физическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2574/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2574" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2574"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgn5e7m/"></a>50 процентов БРВ</p></td><td class="bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2575/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2575" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2575"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas49ufal/"></a>юридическим лицом</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 39%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:left"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2576/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2576" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2576"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswul7hw/"></a>1-кратный размер БРВ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdLeft" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2577/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2577" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2577"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspx11fx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdAll" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2578/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2578" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2578"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7a0877/"></a>16. За оформление выставочных грузов с иностранных юридических лиц и реализацию иностранным юридическим лицам бланков грузовой таможенной декларации</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2579/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2579" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2579"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg15xga/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2580/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2580" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2580"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr10f96/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2581/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2581" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2581"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasab7od7/"></a>а) за оформление выставочных грузов с иностранных юридических лиц из расчета за каждый час работы таможенного органа</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2582/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2582" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2582"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9hw3vz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2583/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2583" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2583"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasme3lbc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2584/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2584" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2584"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas0hph2s/"></a>в дневное (рабочее) время</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2585/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2585" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2585"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasufct74/"></a>2 процента БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2586/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2586" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2586"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasy2k3ww/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2587/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2587" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2587"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbnkv6y/"></a>во внеурочное время (с 18.00 до 9.00 часов)</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2588/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2588" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2588"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3aizh8/"></a>3 процента БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2589/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2589" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2589"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu01ko0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2590/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2590" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2590"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasttu32w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2591/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2591" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2591"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8131c1/"></a>б) за реализацию иностранным юридическим лицам бланков грузовой таможенной декларации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2592/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2592" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2592"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasp3ggqf/"></a>1 процент БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2593/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2593" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2593"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasguyc1h/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2594/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2594" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2594"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaseutud5/"></a>17. За аккредитацию сотрудников негосударственных некоммерческих организаций, в том числе религиозных организаций, представительств и филиалов международных и иностранных негосударственных некоммерческих организаций, являющихся иностранными гражданами, а также членов их семей, находящихся на их иждивении</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2595/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2595" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2595"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgeuggm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2596/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2596" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2596"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6obvo1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2597/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2597" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2597"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1g2g5i/"></a>а) за аккредитацию сотрудников негосударственных некоммерческих организаций, в том числе религиозных организаций, представительств и филиалов международных и иностранных негосударственных некоммерческих организаций, являющихся иностранными гражданами, а также членов их семей, находящихся на их иждивении</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2598/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2598" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2598"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasm25dwi/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2599/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2599" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2599"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszlhyuv/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2600/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2600" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2600"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbettkw/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2601/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2601" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2601"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashwb9e2/"></a>б) за повторную аккредитацию сотрудников негосударственных некоммерческих организаций, в то м числе религиозных организаций, представительств и филиалов международных и иностранных негосударственных некоммерческих организаций, являющихся иностранными гражданами, а также членов их семей, находящихся на их иждивении</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2602/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2602" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2602"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxbrh87/"></a>2,5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2603/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2603" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2603"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas0fxmeh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2604/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2604" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2604"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbtm8xl/"></a>18. За регистрацию браков, а также расторжения браков с участием иностранных граждан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2605/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2605" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2605"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasi7gbg2/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2606/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2606" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2606"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas34wb1h/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2607/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2607" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2607"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdkrpsi/"></a>за регистрацию браков граждан Республики Узбекистан с иностранными гражданами, а также браков иностранных граждан между собой</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2608/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2608" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2608"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastxzx2s/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2609/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2609" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2609"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg5lqro/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2610/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2610" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2610"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasongkpw/"></a>19. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за выдачу и продление срока действия въездной, выездной или въездной-выездной визы для иностранных граждан и лиц без гражданства</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2611/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2611" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2611"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9dbu5n/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="10" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2612/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2612" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2612"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastn2wwh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2613/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2613" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2613"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasp86grb/"></a>а) за выдачу и продление срока действия въездной, выездной или въездной-выездной визы для иностранных граждан и лиц без гражданства на срок</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2614/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2614" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2614"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdqd226/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2615/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2615" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2615"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasux94a6/"></a>до семи дней</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2616/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2616" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2616"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas2wpqbu/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2617/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2617" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2617"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskkrfwy/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2618/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2618" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2618"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr2d160/"></a>до пятнадцати дней</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2619/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2619" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2619"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasoe3ac7/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2620/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2620" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2620"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvd6eeh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2621/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2621" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2621"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascdo0e8/"></a>до тридцати дней</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2622/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2622" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2622"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspi19fl/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2623/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2623" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2623"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaseb8vkq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2624/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2624" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2624"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfast5vxtg/"></a>до трех месяцев</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2625/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2625" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2625"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4o8grn/"></a>3-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2626/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2626" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2626"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasawe88a/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2627/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2627" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2627"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastm23ci/"></a>до шести месяцев</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2628/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2628" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2628"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasra550z/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2629/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2629" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2629"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9il5xa/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2630/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2630" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2630"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8utuvt/"></a>до одного года</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2631/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2631" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2631"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5kt0mn/"></a>6-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2632/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2632" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2632"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasd55xto/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2633/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2633" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2633"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashzsknm/"></a>до одного года для граждан Республики Туркменистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2634/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2634" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2634"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasexme6n/"></a>20-кра?ный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2635/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2635" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2635"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgfzg4e/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2636/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2636" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2636"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasn9phf9/"></a>до одного года для граждан Республики Кыргызстан и Республики Таджикистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2637/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2637" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2637"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgc9qrs/"></a>1 БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2638/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2638" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2638"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslvqnn0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2639/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2639" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2639"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrkfgt0/"></a>до одного года для граждан Соединенных Штатов Америки, проживающих на основе виз, а также граждан Соединенных Штатов Америки, не достигших шестнадцатилетнего возраста</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2640/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2640" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2640"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1kprgx/"></a>6-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2641/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2641" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2641"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvs3neo/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2642/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2642" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2642"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasszu7dg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2643/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2643" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2643"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastf6i0t/"></a>Примечание. За оформление кратности визы ставка пошлины увеличивается на 40 процентов БРВ.</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2644/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2644" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2644"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfnva9d/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="5" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2645/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2645" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2645"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastptg7i/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2646/" data-role="phrase-ancho