: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2658/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2658" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2658"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgkbzua/"></a>14-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2659/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2659" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2659"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgeo1g8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="8" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2660/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2660" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2660"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashlfdk1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2661/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2661" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2661"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgs4hy9/"></a>в) за регистрацию по месту пребывания иностранных граждан и лиц без гражданства на срок действия въездной визы и за продление срока регистрации по месту пребывания на период продления срока действия визы</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2662/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2662" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2662"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvgwt1s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2663/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2663