2692"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasc2716r/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2693/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2693" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2693"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasercwg2/"></a>свыше шести месяцев</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2694/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2694" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2694"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask99cg9/"></a>40 процентов БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2695/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2695" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2695"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr2ugsx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2696/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2696" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2696"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9ih4m5/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2697/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2697" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2697"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8kgf9x/"></a>д) за рассмотрение документов и оформление разрешения иностранному гражданину, включая гражданина государства &#8212; участника СНГ, или лицу без гражданства на постоянное проживание в Республике Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2698/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2698" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2698"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasi5dn4y/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2699/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2699" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2699"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswk8q64/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2700/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2700" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2700"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxgonvg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2701/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2701" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2701"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasc012gy/"></a>е) за выдачу справок иностранному гражданину или лицу без гражданства об утере паспорта или заменяющего его документа</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2702/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2702" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2702"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasztz0nq/"></a>40 процентов БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2703/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2703" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2703"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasl3gz9s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2704/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2704" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2704"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasniachc/"></a>20. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Центральным банком Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2705/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2705" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2705"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas76x3x0/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2706/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2706" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2706"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxptxte/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2707/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2707" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2707"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask9z4ur/"></a>а) банковской деятельности</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2708/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2708" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2708"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask4ytyb/"></a>0,1 процент минимального размера уставного капитала создаваемого банка</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><t