2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2714/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2714" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2714"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas0drzfe/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2715/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2715" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2715"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgukbk4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2716/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2716" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2716"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5gxytc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2717/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2717" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2717"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyflnd2/"></a>е) деятельности платежной организации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2718/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2718" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2718"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbxh0yg/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2719/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2719" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2719"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8320co/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2720/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2720" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2720"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7i2iyn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2721/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2721" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2721"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1bmlm6/"></a>ж) деятельности валютной биржи</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2722/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2722" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2722"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasihcvm7/"></a>4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2723/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2723" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2723"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasezm447/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2724/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2724" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2724"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmt9nde/"></a>21. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством внутренних дел Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2725/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2725" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2725"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmzwbop/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2726/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2726" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2726"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasp2shxt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2727/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2727" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2727"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3h8fcg/"></a>а) производство, ремонт и реализация гражданского и служебного оружия и боевых припасов к нему</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2728/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2728" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2728"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszs8reb/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2729/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2729" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2729"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfb3gnw/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2730/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2730" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2730"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasam56w7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2731/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2731" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2731"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvcxxbe/"></a>в) деятельность по оказанию негосударственных образовательных услуг в сфере подготовки и переподготовки водителей автомототранспортных средств и средств городского электрического транспорта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2732/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2732" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2732"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswh1nvc/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2733/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2733" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2733"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmnoepr/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2734/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2734" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2734"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslgyaby/"></a>22. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Таможенным комитетом при Министерстве экономике и финансов Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2735/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2735" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2735"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnkfg4f/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2736/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2736" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2736"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslhflwq/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2737/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2737" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2737"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdpa4eo/"></a>а) учреждение таможенного склада</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2738/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2738" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2738"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu5kery/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2739/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2739" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2739"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu4si2r/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2740/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2740" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2740"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyaqrgm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2741/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2741" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2741"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask4eq3n/"></a>б) учреждение склада в таможенном режиме &#8212; &#171;свободный склад&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2742/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2742" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2742"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4meblb/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2743/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2743" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2743"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9388pm/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2744/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2744" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2744"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas085kv3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2745/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2745" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2745"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuq98l8/"></a>в) учреждение магазина беспошлинной торговли</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2746/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2746" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2746"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslw0vfm/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2747/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2747" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2747"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas578q8o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2748/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2748" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2748"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasonv6ay/"></a>24. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Агентством по оборонной промышленности при Министерстве обороны Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2749/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2749" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2749"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdpzb9e/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2750/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2750" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2750"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasws7u8u/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2751/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2751" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2751"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskd6qgd/"></a>а) создание, производство, ремонт и реализация вооружения и боеприпасов к нему, средств защиты, военной техники, запасных частей, комплектующих элементов и приборов к ним, если они не используются в других отраслях, а также специальных материалов и специального оборудования для их производства</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2752/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2752" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2752"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7x8oko/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2753/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2753" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2753"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgblw1k/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2754/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2754" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2754"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasybgiir/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2755/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2755" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2755"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6eccgn/"></a>б) ликвидация (уничтожение, утилизация, захоронение) и переработка высвобождаемых военно-технических средств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2756/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2756" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2756"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3szh40/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2757/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2757" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2757"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv4m6ss/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2758/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2758" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2758"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8ghl6o/"></a>25. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Комитетом промышленной, радиационной и ядерной безопасности при Кабинете Министров</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2759/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2759" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2759"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasatna3w/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2760/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2760" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2760"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfassefwah/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2761/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2761" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2761"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3hvrr8/"></a>а) разработка, производство, транспортировка, хранение и реализация взрывчатых и ядовитых веществ, материалов и изделий с их применением, а также средств взрывания</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2762/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2762" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2762"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvq1mqq/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2763/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2763" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2763"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase35glp/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2764/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2764" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2764"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdln53x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2765/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2765" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2765"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3uymd2/"></a>б) деятельность в области использования атомной энергии</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2766/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2766" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2766"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskdy47w/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2767/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2767" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2767"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg9156x/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2768/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2768" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2768"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6ukk7o/"></a>26. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Службой государственной безопасности Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2769/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2769" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2769"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasm3lql8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2770/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2770" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2770"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5mf0xn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2771/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2771" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2771"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas24w4oy/"></a>разработка, производство и реализация средств криптографической защиты информации</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2772/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2772" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2772"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasekagwd/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2773/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2773" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2773"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq2yr61/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2774/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2774" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2774"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfask3mg3b/"></a>27. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности территориальными подразделениями Государственного комитета по развитию туризма</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2775/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2775" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2775"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxox249/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2776/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2776" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2776"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6yhkb5/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2777/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2777" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2777"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgndw6u/"></a>а) туристская деятельность по направлению &#171;внутренний туризм&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2778/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2778" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2778"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaso0qtge/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2779/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2779" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2779"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1cap1f/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2780/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2780" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2780"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasad6pid/"></a>б) туристская деятельность по направлению &#171;выездной туризм&#187; или &#171;въездной туризм&#187; либо для соискателей лицензии на право осуществления туристской деятельности более одного вида направлений</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2781/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2781" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2781"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu4t0ye/"></a>5-кр?тный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2782/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2782" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2782"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasp4mgbs/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2783/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2783" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2783"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvdgqf6/"></a>28. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Комитетом по делам религий Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2784/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2784" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2784"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasts5yob/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2785/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2785" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2785"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszi9pn4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2786/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2786" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2786"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyoyi1z/"></a>а) деятельность религиозных образовательных учреждений</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2787/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2787" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2787"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmgq131/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2788/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2788" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2788"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyli6ga/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2789/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2789" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2789"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspew81k/"></a>б) деятельность по организации и проведению мероприятий &#171;Умра&#187;</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2790/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2790" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2790"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu1pbap/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2791/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2791" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2791"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas0m2od8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2792/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2792" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2792"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasef3si9/"></a>29. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством дошкольного и школьного образования и Министерством высшего образования, науки и инноваций Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2793/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2793" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2793"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastm7dyb/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2794/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2794" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2794"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasc0nw1k/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2795/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2795" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2795"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas42491n/"></a>деятельность в сфере оказания негосударственных образовательных услуг, за исключением деятельности в сфере подготовки и переподготовки водителей автомототранспортных средств и средств городского электрического транспорта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2796/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2796" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2796"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasznndn7/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2797/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2797" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2797"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszti19v/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2798/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2798" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2798"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6svdwy/"></a>30. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Национальным агентством перспективных проектов Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2799/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2799" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2799"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6nh8rb/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="5" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2800/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2800" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2800"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasknleol/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2801/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2801" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2801"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfx8ziy/"></a>а) страховая деятельность страховщиков (перестраховщиков) и страховых брокеров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2802/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2802" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2802"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8mygba/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2803/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2803" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2803"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbugqzz/"></a>б) деятельность фондовой биржи и деятельность организатора внебиржевых торгов ценными бумагами</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2804/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2804" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2804"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasicull1/"></a>4-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2805/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2805" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2805"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3xk0t6/"></a>в) деятельность по организации лотерей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2806/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2806" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2806"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg35hx9/"></a>18 500-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2807/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2807" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2807"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq5g7nw/"></a>г) букмекерская деятельность</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2808/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2808" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2808"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9h8m8i/"></a>37 000-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2809/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2809" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2809"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasaxspnr/"></a>д) деятельность по организации игр, основанных на риске, во всемирной информационной сети Интернет</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2810/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2810" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2810"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9p41hs/"></a>37 000-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2811/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2811" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2811"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasufwv7f/"></a>Примечание. Размеры государственных пошлин, предусмотренных подпунктами &#171;г&#187; и &#171;д&#187;, установлены из расчета на один год кратно размеру базовой расчетной величины, установленной на день платежа государственной пошлины. Государственная пошлина оплачивается ежегодно в установленных размерах.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2812/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2812" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2812"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasge6mgo/"></a>Очередной ежегодный платеж уплачивается не позднее, чем за 30 дней до 1 января года, следующего за годом получения лицензии, в случае неуплаты очередного платежа в установленный срок действие лицензии приостанавливается.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2813/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2813" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2813"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashhh6eg/"></a>За изменение лицензий, предусмотренных подпунктами &#171;в&#187;, &#171;г&#187; и &#171;д&#187;, государственная пошлина уплачивается в размере 50 процентов от размеров государственных пошлин, предусмотренных данными подпунктами.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2814/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2814" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2814"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9pruut/"></a>За переоформление лицензий, предусмотренных подпунктами &#171;в&#187;, &#171;г&#187; и &#171;д&#187;, взимается сбор в 500-кратном размере БРВ.</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2815/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2815" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2815"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7gv5lc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2816/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2816" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2816"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasoniiqq/"></a>31. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством здравоохранения Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2817/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2817" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2817"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9ms6ku/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2818/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2818" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2818"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvkav6n/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2819/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2819" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2819"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasncopq3/"></a>а) деятельность, связанная с оборотом наркотических средств, психотропных веществ и прекурсоров</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2820/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2820" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2820"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasegaemc/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2821/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2821" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2821"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas76hde5/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2822/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2822" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2822"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfassxt9zx/"></a>б) медицинская деятельность</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2823/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2823" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2823"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrqylfe/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2824/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2824" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2824"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas2b6olt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2825/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2825" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2825"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaseanlup/"></a>32. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством строительства и жилищно-коммунального хозяйства Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2826/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2826" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2826"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxz3lgz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2827/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2827" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2827"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu7cf8b/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2828/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2828" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2828"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasncl5er/"></a>а) осуществление деятельности по производству ремонтных, строительно-монтажных работ на высотах методами промышленного альпинизма</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2829/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2829" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2829"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspasgby/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2830/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2830" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2830"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8akzrc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2831/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2831" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2831"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgf9sbg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2832/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2832" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2832"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasn4rsk6/"></a>б) осуществление деятельности по проектированию, строительству и ремонту мостов и тоннелей</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2833/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2833" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2833"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrmgv1c/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2834/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2834" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2834"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrzykn4/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2835/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2835" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2835"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5p7z9o/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2836/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2836" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2836"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvr5txe/"></a>г) осуществление деятельности по проектированию, строительству, эксплуатации объектов повышенного риска и потенциально опасных производств</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2837/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2837" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2837"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnkd3l2/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2838/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2838" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2838"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmbze4e/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" rowspan="12" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2839/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2839" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2839"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas04u84e/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2840/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2840" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2840"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfastpdi04/"></a>д) разработка документации о планировании развития территории и частей территории Республики Узбекистан</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2841/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2841" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2841"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashtolnd/"></a>50-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2842/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2842" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2842"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasm8ro5s/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2843/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2843" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2843"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxyzq3s/"></a>ж) разработка документации по строительству и развитию территорий населенных пунктов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2844/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2844" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2844"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaspy1gu2/"></a>40-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2845/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2845" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2845"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas9v3pcg/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2846/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2846" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2846"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasti6b4t/"></a>и) выполнение инженерно-технических (за исключением инженерно-геодезических) изысканий под объекты строительства</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2847/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2847" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2847"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas77vwd0/"></a>50-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2848/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2848" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2848"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfast6ptds/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2849/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2849" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2849"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfq20pi/"></a>к) разработка проектно-сметной документации на строительство объектов и комплексов жилищно-гражданского назначения, включая проектирование их инженерных сетей и систем</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2850/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2850" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2850"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqpw1l7/"></a>75-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2851/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2851" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2851"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasza5gcn/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2852/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2852" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2852"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasegigdi/"></a>л) разработка проектно-сметной документации на строительство объектов и комплексов промышленного назначения, включая проектирование их инженерных сетей и систем</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2853/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2853" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2853"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfassqhyf5/"></a>75-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2854/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2854" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2854"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1hh4f9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2855/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2855" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2855"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasmqdbkq/"></a>м) разработка проектно-сметной документации на строительство объектов и комплексов водохозяйственного назначения, включая проектирование их инженерных сетей и систем</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2856/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2856" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2856"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasx9o0sa/"></a>50-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2857/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2857" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2857"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr69455/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2858/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2858" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2858"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasisnbog/"></a>н) разработка проектно-сметной документации на строительство объектов и комплексов сельскохозяйственного назначения, включая проектирование их инженерных сетей и систем</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2859/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2859" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2859"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdcha1l/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2860/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2860" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2860"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasf8qonh/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr2861/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2861" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2861"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv52cz7/"></a>о) проектирование объектов и комплексов энергетического строи