77/bssPhr3171/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3171" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3171"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas2w2087/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3172/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3172" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3172"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7yglhg/"></a>частная нотариальная деятельность</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3173/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3173" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3173"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbiiva7/"></a>1 БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3174/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3174" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3174"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswsu50n/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3175/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3175" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3175"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasb14sr3/"></a>47. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Агентством по развитию фармацевтической отрасли при Министерстве здравоохранения Республики Узбекистан и его территориальными подразделениями:</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3176/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3176" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3176"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuztb9c/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3177/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3177" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3177"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas14kczu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3178/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3178" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3178"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyfb5te/"></a>фармацевтическая деятельность</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3179/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3179" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3179"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascwvngc/"></a>10-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3180/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3180" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3180"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasstccrl/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3181/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3181" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3181"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgs5702/"></a>49.Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством сельского хозяйства Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3182/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3182" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3182"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqwxb96/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3183/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3183" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3183"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasx775cd/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3184/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3184" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3184"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu0p9o2/"></a>а) культивирование (волокно и семена) растения каннабис с содержанием наркотического средства тетрагидроканнабинол до 0,2 процента в промышленных целях, не связанных с производством или изготовлением наркотических средств и психотропных веществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3185/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3185" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3185"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfassgxt0i/"></a>3000-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3186/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3186" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3186"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswm2lzy/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3187/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3187" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3187"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasuany68/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3188/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3188" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3188"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasag8b44/"></a>б) ввоз (вывоз) (волокно и семена) растения каннабис с содержанием наркотического средства тетрагидроканнабинол до 0,2 процента в промышленных целях, не связанных с производством или изготовлением наркотических средств и психотропных веществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3189/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3189" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3189"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswnmebx/"></a>200-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3190/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3190" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3190"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasven1g6/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3191/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3191" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3191"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaskky8we/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3192/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3192" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3192"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyd4m5l/"></a>в) переработка (волокно и семена) растения каннабис с содержанием наркотического средства тетрагидроканнабинол до 0,2 процента в промышленных целях, не связанных с производством или изготовлением наркотических средств и психотропных веществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3193/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3193" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3193"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase2509r/"></a>200-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3194/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3194" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3194"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasa8a41b/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3195/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3195" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3195"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfk7ztz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3196/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3196" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3196"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq1pz86/"></a>г) хранение (волокно и семена) растения каннабис с содержанием наркотического средства тетрагидроканнабинол до 0,2 процента в промышленных целях, не связанных с производством или изготовлением наркотических средств и психотропных веществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style=