ocument/90/21477/bssPhr3202/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3202" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3202"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4yo9p3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3203/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3203" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3203"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfccohs/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3204/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3204" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3204"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas2gutr7/"></a>е) приобретение (волокно и семена) растения каннабис с содержанием наркотического средства тетрагидроканнабинол до 0,2 процента в промышленных целях, не связанных с производством или изготовлением наркотических средств и психотропных веществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3205/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3205" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3205"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasll3hp7/"></a>200-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3206/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3206" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3206"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8cm5bt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3207/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3207" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3207"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas0p5cel/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3208/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3208" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3208"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswgtxbx/"></a>ж) перевозка (волокно и семена) растения каннабис с содержанием наркотического средства тетрагидроканнабинол до 0,2 процента в промышленных целях, не связанных с производством или изготовлением наркотических средств и психотропных веществ</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3209/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3209" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3209"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfassg7d3m/"></a>200-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3210/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3210" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3210"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasit0il3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3211/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3211" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3211"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas503zes/"></a>50. Государственная пошлина за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Инспекцией по регулированию алкогольного и табачного рынка при Департаменте по борьбе с экономическими преступлениями при Генеральной прокуратуре Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3212/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3212" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3212"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv2099g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3213/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3213" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3213"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashig4pi/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3214/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3214" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3214"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas8b2419/"></a>а) деятельность по оптовой торговле алкогольной продукцией</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3215/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3215" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3215"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgd6icg/"></a>200-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3216/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3216" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3216"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasorr3e8/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3217/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3217" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3217"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasb7whyd/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3218/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3218" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3218"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq8h0bu/"></a>б) деятельность по производству потребительского и технического этилового спирта, алкогольной продукции:</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3219/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3219" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3219"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgnvsy9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3220/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3220" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3220"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg3rv71/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3221/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3221" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3221"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashf482x/"></a>производство пищевого этилового ректификованного спирта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3222/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3222" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3222"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasx887qc/"></a>100-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3223/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3223" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3223"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascng0x3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3224/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3224" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3224"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasb68cnx/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3225/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3225" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3225"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1e2yoq/"></a>производство технического этилового спирта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3226/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3226" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3226"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaset8ndw/"></a>25-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3227/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3227" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3227"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas36kuh1/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3228/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3228" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3228"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasakh1i5/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3229/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3229" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3229"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqixfhy/"></a>производство водки и ликеро-водочной продукции из пищевого этилового спирта</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3230/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3230" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3230"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv9o3s6/"></a>250-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3231/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3231" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3231"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrgvgkt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3232/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3232" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3232"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyh1elb/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3233/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3233" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3233"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasekggx5/"></a>производство винных напитков крепостью от 7,0 до 22,0 процентов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3234/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3234" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3234"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasahazw2/"></a>250-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3235/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3235" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3235"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasi0donc/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3236/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3236" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3236"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasm3q8k9/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3237/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3237" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3237"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasluvx1o/"></a>производство водки виноградной и плодовой, вина виноградного и плодово-ягодного, коньяка, коньячного напитка, бренди, виски, рома, кальвадоса</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3238/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3238" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3238"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas4xnmvf/"></a>100-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3239/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3239" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3239"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgpw194/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3240/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3240" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3240"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasudlyyz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3241/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3241" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3241"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas666ivn/"></a>производство спирта виноградного и плодово-ягодного, винного спирта, спирта-сырца виноградного и плодово-ягодного, дистиллята виноградного, винного, коньячного, вискового, ромового, плодово-ягодного и кальвадосного, вина игристого и газированного</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3242/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3242" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3242"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas803a5l/"></a>50-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3243/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3243" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3243"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasr9a8as/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3244/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3244" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3244"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaso4v5z3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3245/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3245" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3245"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszntbfo/"></a>производство виноградных и плодово-ягодных виноматериалов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3246/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3246" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3246"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszr78w7/"></a>25-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="5" style="width: 96%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3247/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3247" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3247"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasq5xspd/"></a><em>Примечание.</em> За право осуществления производства пищевого и технического этилового спирта, алкогольной продукции государственная пошлина уплачивается один раз в год в зависимости от вида каждой группы.</p><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3248/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3248" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3248"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasf0d6hs/"></a>Очередной ежегодный платеж уплачивается не позднее, чем за 30 дней до начала очередного года использования лицензии, в случае неуплаты очередного платежа в установленный срок действие лицензии приостанавливается.</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3249/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3249" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3249"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas14evz5/"></a>в) производство табачной продукции</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3250/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3250" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3250"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas12p6o1/"></a>200-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3251/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3251" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3251"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasp42rk3/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3252/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3252" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3252"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaswu0ex9/"></a>51. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование видов деятельности на рынке электрической энергии</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3253/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3253" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3253"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas6g8ozt/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight bdLeft" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3254/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3254" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3254"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasnckd9q/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3255/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3255" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3255"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5g1z3v/"></a>Деятельность по производству электрической энергии</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3256/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3256" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3256"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasw49zwg/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3257/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3257" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3257"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1lig29/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3258/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3258" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3258"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasdgdl44/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3259/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3259" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3259"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbf24cr/"></a>Деятельность по передаче электрической энергии</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3260/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3260" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3260"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfash243ll/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3261/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3261" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3261"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfgbl41/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3262/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3262" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3262"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszfyl5p/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3263/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3263" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3263"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasfb6r48/"></a>Деятельность по распределению электрической энергии</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3264/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3264" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3264"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7gskkq/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3265/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3265" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3265"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1mfcbk/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3266/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3266" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3266"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashtcv3q/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3267/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3267" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3267"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasrsr3ml/"></a>Деятельность по хранению электрической энергии</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3268/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3268" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3268"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashbgf3p/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3269/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3269" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3269"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaszlyqo7/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3270/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3270" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3270"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas7gpk1g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3271/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3271" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3271"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasc75fnt/"></a>Деятельность по снабжению электрической энергией</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3272/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3272" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3272"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasggg5c8/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3273/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3273" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3273"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashtv8bz/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3274/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3274" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3274"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasvgk49g/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3275/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3275" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3275"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg6ummo/"></a>Деятельность центрального закупщика</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3276/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3276" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3276"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasioa87l/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3277/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3277" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3277"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasf979pu/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3278/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3278" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3278"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasysu479/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3279/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3279" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3279"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaslspbig/"></a>Деятельность оператора рынка электрической энергии</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3280/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3280" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3280"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfascx4z1s/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3281/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3281" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3281"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxxk5xs/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3282/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3282" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3282"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxghy9i/"></a>&#160;</td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3283/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3283" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3283"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasgpcgt9/"></a>Деятельность по торговле электрической энергией</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3284/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3284" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3284"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasyphg26/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3285/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3285" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3285"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasffwlid/"></a>52. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Агентством по карантину и защите растений при Министерстве сельского хозяйства Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" rowspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3286/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3286" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3286"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas5v4bxt/"></a>а) деятельность по оптовой и розничной торговле минеральными удобрениями и химическими средствами, используемыми для защиты растений</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3287/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3287" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3287"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas172zvr/"></a>2-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3288/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3288" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3288"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas1h9cyo/"></a>б) деятельность по фумигации вывозимой из Республики Узбекистан подкарантинной продукции</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3289/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3289" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3289"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfase7i92g/"></a>3-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3290/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3290" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3290"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasv5dy05/"></a>53. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Агентством миграции при Кабинете Министров Республики Узбекистан:</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3291/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3291" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3291"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasurizs9/"></a>трудоустройство лиц, ищущих работу за пределами Республики Узбекистан, частными агентствами занятости.</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3292/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3292" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3292"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfashosm7t/"></a>3-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3293/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3293" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3293"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas3svrsy/"></a>54. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством по чрезвычайным ситуациям Республики Узбекистан:</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3294/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3294" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3294"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasbx17xt/"></a>монтаж, наладка, ремонт и техническое обслуживание устройств автоматического пожаротушения и пожарной сигнализации</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3295/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3295" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3295"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfaso7gn47/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3296/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3296" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3296"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasg1i7z7/"></a>55. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Государственной инспекцией пробирного надзора при Министерстве экономики и финансов Республики Узбекистан:</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3297/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3297" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3297"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfas2z7san/"></a>аффинажная деятельность</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3298/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3298" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3298"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasu2sx0b/"></a>5-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="7" style="width: 99%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3299/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3299" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3299"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasxrq3yt/"></a>56. Государственная пошлина, уплачиваемая за лицензирование отдельных видов деятельности Министерством горнодобывающей промышленности и геологии Республики Узбекистан</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3300/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3300" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3300"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfass4qql7/"></a>деятельность по заготовке (закупке), переработке и реализации лома и отходов черных металлов</p></td><td class="bdTop bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3301/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3301" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3301"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasi9pfkw/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr><tr allowpartbreak="false"><td class="bdRight" style="width: 0%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 3%; word-wrap: break-word"></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="3" style="width: 57%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3302/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3302" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3302"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasi4rnwx/"></a>деятельность по заготовке (закупке), переработке и реализации лома и отходов цветных металлов</p></td><td class="bdBottom bdRight" colspan="2" style="width: 38%; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/bssPhr3303/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="3303" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr3303"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/21477/dfasqopp3u/"></a>30-кратный размер БРВ</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></html></div></div><div xmlns="" class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 29.09.2026</div></body></html>